[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    56[0m:[38;5;10m[49m range check exists in the C:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    57[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `n = h >> 10` with `h` 16-bit ⇒ `n ∈ [0, 63]`, and both `m__offset` and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `m__exponent` have exactly 64 elements.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `(h & 0x3ff) + m__offset[n]` ⇒ at most `0x3ff + 0x400 = 0x7ff = 2047`, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `m__mantissa` has exactly 2048 elements.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    62[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Boundary conditions tested anyway (Phase C)
