[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 1 — public entry points (full set, including the lowest level)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `c_src/include/lib.h` declares exactly one function, and `nm -D` on the C `.so`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m exports exactly one symbol: `half2float`. There is **no** convenience/one-shot
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m wrapper layered over a lower-level API, and no `_ex`/`_with_options` variant —
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `half2float` *is* the lowest-level entry point. The three lookup tables are
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `static` (file-local) and unreachable from outside. So this axis has exactly one
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m value, and testing it is testing the lowest level directly.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 2 — runtime options / modes / flags
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Enumerated by grepping the public header and the C source for settable state:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m there is no config struct, no setter, no init function, no global or
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m thread-local mutable state, no environment-variable read, and no `#ifdef` /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `#if` conditional compilation anywhere in `lib.c`. `half2float` is a pure
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m function of its single argument. **This axis is empty** — zero flags to combine.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Correspondingly, `translation/Cargo.toml` declares no `[features]` section, so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m there is exactly one Rust build configuration (see Phase D).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 3 — input shapes the code actually special-cases
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Derived from the branch-free indexing arithmetic, since the *tables* encode the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m case distinctions that a branchy implementation would put in `if`s:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **`n = h >> 10` ∈ [0, 63]** — 64 distinct table rows, one per value.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **`m__offset[n]` ∈ {0x0000, 0x0400}** — `0x0000` only for `n = 0` and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `n = 32`; `0x0400` for the other 62. This selects **which half of
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `m__mantissa` is read**: the low region `[0, 1023]` (subnormal-half decoding,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   each entry a differently-scaled normal float) or the high region
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `[1024, 2047]` (normal-half decoding, entries `0x38000000 + m*0x2000`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **`m__exponent[n]` class** — 6 distinct classes:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `0x00000000` (n=0), regular positive `0x00800000..0x0f000000` (n=1..30),
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   special positive `0x47800000` (n=31), sign-only `0x80000000` (n=32),
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   regular negative `0x80800000..0x8f000000` (n=33..62),
